1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
What if identifying wildlife could become more than just recognizing a species?
What if every sighting could become an opportunity to learn, explore, and protect biodiversity?

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Meet Wildora — an interactive wildlife discovery platform built around India's incredible biodiversity.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:50,000
A user can upload a photograph of a wildlife observation.
Wildora is designed to analyze the observation and provide meaningful information about the species.

4
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:15,000
For example, this observation is identified as the Indian Peafowl.
Wildora provides its common and scientific name, taxonomic group, confidence level, habitat, ecological role, conservation information, and interesting facts.

5
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:35,000
But Wildora adds another layer to wildlife discovery.
The real animal can inspire a fictional fantasy companion that users can collect.

6
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Every observation also contributes to progression.
Users can earn XP, level up, discover new species and taxonomic groups, and unlock achievements.

7
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Over time, these discoveries become part of the user's wildlife collection,
turning real-world observation into an ongoing exploration experience.

8
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Observations can also be associated with locations and visualized through the biodiversity atlas.

9
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Wildora makes wildlife discovery more interactive while keeping real biodiversity at the center.
Discover wildlife. Earn companions. Protect biodiversity.